1. Quit smoking check-in, record time, place, number of participants, mood and custom labels and other information to help you grasp the smoking scene and effectively avoid more smoking;
2. Smoking map, showing smoking location and path information, so that you can understand your smoking situation more clearly;
3. Smoking calendar, which records the time and information of smoking in detail, which is convenient for you to analyze and review;
4. Smoking charts, displaying information such as smoking ratio and ranking, to help you analyze your problems and better achieve your goal of quitting smoking.
